  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": [
        "Machines only draw from generators within 8 blocks. Once your camp spreads out, you will want Pulse to travel.",
        "Draw a chalk line between two totems: right-click one with **Ritual Chalk** (bone meal, lapis and a Spirit Shard make four sticks), then the other, less than 16 blocks away. \"Lattice link sealed\" means it worked.",
        "A [Lattice Conductor](lattice_conductor) near those totems and near a generator then fills the totems from the generator; each holds 250 Pulse. Stations near any linked totem can draw on it.",
        "Conductors also carry the zone by themselves: place them within 8 of each other and of the generator, and a machine within 8 of any of them draws on the line. One craft makes four."
      ]
    },
